"""Hand-written data for the Saint Jude 1975 starting snapshot (worlds/saintjude/seed.json).

tools/build_saintjude_seed.py turns this into the seed JSON.  Amend the data here and regenerate.

Day 0 is Wednesday 1 January 1975.  The source codex describes 1980, so every codex person is five years
younger and holds the post a man of that age plausibly held in 1975.  Every re-assignment is recorded by
the person record itself (post_1980, post_1975, reason) and ends up in meta.backdating_notes.

Authoring rules (owner): the codex is changeable source material; no pressures, no character secrets,
no trial, shipment or informant; motives are ordinary traits, not plot hooks; positions of power are
clearly but not exclusively male (about 92 percent in formal power, 85 percent in business and civic
roles, underworld leadership most male); names match sex; unnamed men added for back-dating are marked.
"""
